## Executive Summary {#executive-summary-heading}

:::note {.summary-card type="info"}
This page contains the narrative summary. It intentionally has enough content
to make page simulation visible and to exercise stable anchors.
::: note

The report tracks operational readiness, documentation quality, security review
status, and integration readiness. Each section has a stable ID so the generated
TOC can navigate to it.

